        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>狗狗训练指南</title>\n<style>\n    body {\n        font-family: 'Comic Sans MS', 'Chalkboard SE', sans-serif;\n        background-color: #e0e0e0;\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: center;\n        padding: 20px;\n        margin: 0;\n    }\n    .container {\n        background-color: #fffaf0;\n        border: 3px solid #4a3022;\n        width: 650px;\n        padding: 25px;\n        color: #222;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n    .header-row {\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        margin-bottom: 15px;\n    }\n    .title-box {\n        background-color: #fae3d9;\n        color: #4a2511;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        font-size: 22px;\n        padding: 4px 12px;\n        border-radius: 6px;\n        margin-right: 15px;\n        border: 1px solid #e8c8b5;\n    }\n    .subtitle {\n        color: #558b2f;\n        font-size: 18px;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        letter-spacing: 1px;\n    }\n    .content-row {\n        display: flex;\n        margin-bottom: 10px;\n    }\n    .image-col {\n        flex: 0 0 160px;\n        margin-right: 15px;\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n        align-items: center;\n    }\n    .text-col {\n        flex: 1;\n    }\n    .point {\n        margin-bottom: 12px;\n        line-height: 1.6;\n        font-size: 17px;\n    }\n    .highlight {\n        background-color: #fae3d9;\n        padding: 0 4px;\n        border-radius: 2px;\n    }\n    .full-width-point {\n        margin-bottom: 15px;\n        line-height: 1.6;\n        font-size: 17px;\n    }\n    .placeholder {\n        background-color: #f5f5f5;\n        border: 1px dashed #aaa;\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        justify-content: center;\n        color: #888;\n        font-size: 14px;\n        text-align: center;\n        padding: 10px;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n    .corgi-img {\n        width: 140px;\n        height: 160px;\n    }\n    .walking-sequence-img {\n        width: 100%;\n        height: 140px;\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n    .divider {\n        border-top: 2px dashed #bcaaa4;\n        margin: 25px 0;\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"container\">\n    <!-- Section 1 -->\n    <div class=\"header-row\">\n        <div class=\"title-box\">稳定随行</div>\n        <div class=\"subtitle\">训练狗狗跟着人走而不是人跟着狗走</div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"content-row\">\n        <div class=\"image-col\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder corgi-img\">[Illustration: Corgi dog standing]</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"text-col\">\n            <div class=\"point\">\n                ① 前期可以选择<span class=\"highlight\">靠墙位置</span>，用玩具或零食<span class=\"highlight\">吸引狗狗注意力在人身上</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"point\">\n                ② 如果狗狗出现前冲或者爆冲行为，主人要<span class=\"highlight\">握紧牵绳，原地保持不动</span>，或者右转90度，让狗狗走在你身后\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"full-width-point\">\n        ③ 狗狗一旦回头找你或者牵引绳恢复了松弛状态，你再继续走，重复多次\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"placeholder walking-sequence-img\">[Illustration: Three scenes of a person walking a dog on a leash]</div>\n    \n    <!-- Divider -->\n    <div class=\"divider\"></div>\n    \n    <!-- Section 2 -->\n    <div class=\"header-row\">\n        <div class=\"title-box\">拒食训练</div>\n        <div class=\"subtitle\">训练狗狗不随便在外面捡东西吃</div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"content-row\">\n        <div class=\"image-col\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder corgi-img\" style=\"height: 180px;\">[Illustration: Corgi dog holding a bone]</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"text-col\">\n            <div class=\"point\">\n                ① 系上牵引绳，将狗狗爱吃的零食放在手上，当它想吃的时候，<span class=\"highlight\">拉绳子说NO</span>，并握紧食物，反复训练直到狗狗看到手中食物就避开\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"full-width-point\">\n        ② 当狗狗能做到在手里的食物可以成功拒食后，<span class=\"highlight\">可以把食物放在地上</span>，带狗狗经过，狗狗嗅闻的时候，拉绳子说NO，直到狗狗无视地上食物\n    </div>\n\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
